WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.328
- [Voiceover] So I see on your resume

00:00:01.328 --> 00:00:02.648
you just graduated college.

00:00:02.648 --> 00:00:05.768
- I did, I did just
graduate college, cum laude.

00:00:05.768 --> 00:00:08.988
- [Voiceover] So, what are
some things you learned

00:00:08.988 --> 00:00:11.428
in college that you think
would apply to this job?

00:00:11.428 --> 00:00:13.708
(percussive music)

00:00:13.708 --> 00:00:15.729
- Um, I think I learned a lot in college

00:00:15.729 --> 00:00:17.848
that would help me in this job,

00:00:17.848 --> 00:00:19.728
a lot of skills I picked up on.

00:00:19.728 --> 00:00:24.228
I learned things like
teamwork, multitasking,

00:00:24.228 --> 00:00:27.188
I think I learned leadership skills.

00:00:27.188 --> 00:00:29.028
All right, so you're
gonna be the D.D. tonight,

00:00:29.028 --> 00:00:30.988
yeah you are, nose goes, bam.

00:00:30.988 --> 00:00:33.728
I'm really good with managing money.

00:00:33.728 --> 00:00:36.308
I am a good problem solver.

00:00:36.308 --> 00:00:37.708
Hey, Dad?

00:00:37.708 --> 00:00:39.468
I always had a good academic record.

00:00:39.468 --> 00:00:42.348
So if I need a 70% to pass the class,

00:00:42.348 --> 00:00:45.108
and I got a 78 on the
paper, then that means

00:00:45.108 --> 00:00:47.008
I only need a 71 on the final.

00:00:47.008 --> 00:00:48.988
Hey guys, I'm going out tonight!

00:00:48.988 --> 00:00:50.848
I'm a good communicator.

00:00:50.848 --> 00:00:53.728
I have an astounding perseverance.

00:00:53.728 --> 00:00:56.948
I am quite the motivator.
Chug, chug, chug!

00:00:56.948 --> 00:00:59.488
I love researching things,

00:00:59.488 --> 00:01:02.367
I have good time management skills,

00:01:02.367 --> 00:01:03.928
I have passion.

00:01:03.928 --> 00:01:06.648
Woo! We going to the natty championship!

00:01:06.648 --> 00:01:08.128
And yeah, I really think that

00:01:08.128 --> 00:01:10.228
college prepared me for this job.

00:01:10.228 --> 00:01:13.128
- [Voiceover] Well, everything looks good,

00:01:13.128 --> 00:01:16.447
except for the fact that this
is an entry level position

00:01:16.447 --> 00:01:19.608
and we do require three
years of experience.

00:01:19.608 --> 00:01:21.673
So...

00:01:23.043 --> 00:01:24.483
this won't work out.

00:01:24.483 --> 00:01:26.163
- Yeah, makes sense.

00:01:26.163 --> 00:01:27.523
Silly me.

00:01:27.523 --> 00:01:31.594
(percussive music)

